\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Top: the collapsing pure-quadrupole run ($\varepsilon _2=0.01$, no radial perturbation) against time. (a)~Minimal-surface areal radius (ink) and MOTS radius (gold); grey, the unperturbed level-4 run, from which this run departs by $10\%$ only at $t=42$, through the quadrupole's second-order effect. (b)--(d)~Global $\min \alpha $, $\min \chi $ (at the origin, the compactified far asymptotic end) and $\max |K|$. (e),(f)~Radial profiles of $|K|$ and $\alpha $ over 128{} shells, $t=33$--$55$ (light = early). Constraint norms: Fig.~\ref {fig:constraints}(c). Movie: Video~1; \href  {https://youtu.be/Cc87mHcBPOA}{\nolinkurl  {youtu.be/Cc87mHcBPOA}}. The throat collapses to a black hole whose horizon then shrinks. Bottom: the inflating $\varepsilon =-10^{-2}$ run against time, to $t=218$. (a)~Neck areal radius; gold, the exponential onset; shaded, exponential growth in the neck's proper time (gold) and the slower growth in $t$ once the $1{+}\log $ slicing freezes the neck's lapse (grey). (b)~The neck's proper-time growth rate $HR_0$, against the massless throat's~\cite  {shinkai2002} and the linear mode's. (c)~Areal radii of the $\theta _-=0$ and $\theta _+=0$ surfaces. (d)~Lapse at the neck; dashed, its minimum on the finest level. (e),(f)~$\max |K|$ and $\min \chi $ on the finest level. (g),(h)~$\chi $ and $\alpha $ per shell (light = early). Constraint norms: Fig.~\ref {fig:constraints}(d). Movie: Video~2; \href  {https://youtu.be/RIQCitu4tSc}{\nolinkurl  {youtu.be/RIQCitu4tSc}}. The throat keeps growing and stays anti-trapped.}}{9}{figure.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:single_collapse}{{4}{9}{Top: the collapsing pure-quadrupole run ($\varepsilon _2=\clmPureQuadAmpCaption $, no radial perturbation) against time. (a)~Minimal-surface areal radius (ink) and MOTS radius (gold); grey, the unperturbed level-4 run, from which this run departs by $10\%$ only at $t=\clmPureQuadDeparture $, through the quadrupole's second-order effect. (b)--(d)~Global $\min \alpha $, $\min \chi $ (at the origin, the compactified far asymptotic end) and $\max |K|$. (e),(f)~Radial profiles of $|K|$ and $\alpha $ over \clmCollapseShells {} shells, $t=33$--$55$ (light = early). Constraint norms: Fig.~\ref {fig:constraints}(c). Movie: Video~1; \href {https://youtu.be/Cc87mHcBPOA}{\nolinkurl {youtu.be/Cc87mHcBPOA}}. The throat collapses to a black hole whose horizon then shrinks. Bottom: the inflating $\varepsilon =-10^{-2}$ run against time, to $t=\clmFourWall $. (a)~Neck areal radius; gold, the exponential onset; shaded, exponential growth in the neck's proper time (gold) and the slower growth in $t$ once the $1{+}\log $ slicing freezes the neck's lapse (grey). (b)~The neck's proper-time growth rate $HR_0$, against the massless throat's~\cite {shinkai2002} and the linear mode's. (c)~Areal radii of the $\theta _-=0$ and $\theta _+=0$ surfaces. (d)~Lapse at the neck; dashed, its minimum on the finest level. (e),(f)~$\max |K|$ and $\min \chi $ on the finest level. (g),(h)~$\chi $ and $\alpha $ per shell (light = early). Constraint norms: Fig.~\ref {fig:constraints}(d). Movie: Video~2; \href {https://youtu.be/RIQCitu4tSc}{\nolinkurl {youtu.be/RIQCitu4tSc}}. The throat keeps growing and stays anti-trapped}{figure.4}{}}
\newlabel{fig:single_inflation}{{4}{9}{Top: the collapsing pure-quadrupole run ($\varepsilon _2=\clmPureQuadAmpCaption $, no radial perturbation) against time. (a)~Minimal-surface areal radius (ink) and MOTS radius (gold); grey, the unperturbed level-4 run, from which this run departs by $10\%$ only at $t=\clmPureQuadDeparture $, through the quadrupole's second-order effect. (b)--(d)~Global $\min \alpha $, $\min \chi $ (at the origin, the compactified far asymptotic end) and $\max |K|$. (e),(f)~Radial profiles of $|K|$ and $\alpha $ over \clmCollapseShells {} shells, $t=33$--$55$ (light = early). Constraint norms: Fig.~\ref {fig:constraints}(c). Movie: Video~1; \href {https://youtu.be/Cc87mHcBPOA}{\nolinkurl {youtu.be/Cc87mHcBPOA}}. The throat collapses to a black hole whose horizon then shrinks. Bottom: the inflating $\varepsilon =-10^{-2}$ run against time, to $t=\clmFourWall $. (a)~Neck areal radius; gold, the exponential onset; shaded, exponential growth in the neck's proper time (gold) and the slower growth in $t$ once the $1{+}\log $ slicing freezes the neck's lapse (grey). (b)~The neck's proper-time growth rate $HR_0$, against the massless throat's~\cite {shinkai2002} and the linear mode's. (c)~Areal radii of the $\theta _-=0$ and $\theta _+=0$ surfaces. (d)~Lapse at the neck; dashed, its minimum on the finest level. (e),(f)~$\max |K|$ and $\min \chi $ on the finest level. (g),(h)~$\chi $ and $\alpha $ per shell (light = early). Constraint norms: Fig.~\ref {fig:constraints}(d). Movie: Video~2; \href {https://youtu.be/RIQCitu4tSc}{\nolinkurl {youtu.be/RIQCitu4tSc}}. The throat keeps growing and stays anti-trapped}{figure.4}{}}
